  "title": "Equity award and tax-payment planning",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Equity award and tax-payment planning</h2><p>Prepare compensation, basis, and estimated-payment amounts under the supplied rules.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f1\">Option compensation income</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f2\">Stock basis after exercise</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f3\">Required annual tax payment</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f4\">Additional estimated payments after withholding</label><input id=\"tcp-m1-tbs1-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
